  "created": 1782470358997,
  "description": "This automation runs when the Solution Matrix form is submitted on a Solve Ticket. It records the submission, unlocks the form when permitted by the current workflow status, and extracts the submitted form values into a structured JSON document stored in the Solution Matrix JSON field. The field update serves as a trigger for the SOLVE: Solution Matrix Field Change Listener, which consumes the JSON payload and executes the downstream processing and synchronization logic required by the SOLVE application.",
